From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2020 12:48:08 +0200
Subject: adds neteq fifo buffer with events

This patch adds a new NetEq implemetation using a FIFO buffer that will be used in copresent mode on the secondary devices in a group so that the audio will be consistently in sync with other members of the group. It also adds support for two events onbufferdrained and onbufferrestored to notify to the js side.

Signed-off-by: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>

